# fill.fio — ENOSPC preparator for chaos drill (c): sequential write until the
# filesystem is full (fill_fs=1: fio grows files until ENOSPC/EDQUOT ends the job).
# Files land in their own directory so the drill can free them selectively.
# Placeholders (engine substitutes): __DIR__
[fill]
name=fill
ioengine=posixaio
buffered=1
direct=0
iodepth=1
directory=__DIR__
filename_format=fill$filenum
nrfiles=8
filesize=64g
rw=write
bs=1m
fill_fs=1
fsync_on_close=1
group_reporting=1
